        <mxCell id="legend" parent="1" style="rounded=1;arcSize=3;html=0;whiteSpace=wrap;fontFamily=Arial;fontSize=19;fontColor=#243746;fillColor=#ffffff;strokeColor=#aab8c2;strokeWidth=2;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacingLeft=12;spacingTop=10;" value="TRAFFIC AND CONTROL PLANE&#10;Blue: customer steering. Orange: IPsec, with BGP on delivery.&#10;Teal: provider forwarding. Dashed red: provider-internal management.&#10;Dashed purple: ingress Route Server BGP with the gateway.&#10;Route Server exchanges routes; it does not carry packets." vertex="1">
